---
# /loom/touchosc/ : the TouchOSC layout for LOOM, and how to connect an iPad to it.
#
# The layout file is a copy of tools/touchosc/LOOM.tosc in the LOOM repo, where its generator lives.
# Regenerate it there and copy it here; do not edit the copy. The setup steps match the "Using an iPad
# as a controller with TouchOSC" section of the LOOM manual's MIDI mapping page.
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /loom/touchosc/
title: "LOOM TouchOSC layout for iPad"
seoTitle: "LOOM TouchOSC Layout: Control the LOOM Looper from an iPad"
description: "A free TouchOSC layout that turns an iPad into a pad controller for LOOM, with setup steps for TouchOSC Bridge on the Mac."
ownFooter: true
faviconSvg: /assets/loom/loom-favicon.svg
favicon16: /assets/loom/favicon-16.png
favicon: /assets/loom/favicon-32.png
---
